OL,3,GNEWSADisabled riding charity fears
OL,4,Afuture over access row
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol City Council said if objections
OL,7,Fare not withdrawn, the application will
OL,8,Fbe passed to the Planning Inspectorate
OL,9,Ffor a decision.
